      "max": 3.4,
      "note": "R07: tightened to 3.3 V +/-3 % (incl. load transients) so that the MN820 module-level VOH 2.4 V (MN820 DS Table 3) still meets F133 VIH = 0.7*VCC-IO; see check level.compatible[BT_IO1:MN820->F133]"
