    "F133_CORE": {
      "nominal": null,
      "note": "VDD-CORE/VDD-SYS/DRAM rails NOT transcribed in R06; take from F133 DS Table 5-2 and a reference design"
    },
    "AMP_VIN": {
      "nominal": null,
      "note": "speaker amplifier supply: reserved, not selected"
    }
  },
  "power_sequence": [
    "1V2_T35 (T35 VCC + VCCA_xx) first (T35 DS 'Power Up Sequence' step 1)",
    "3V3 within 10 ms after 1V2_T35 is stable (T35 step 2; ramp VCCIO/10 V/ms .. 10 V/ms); also F133 VCC-IO/PD/PE/PG, PSRAM VDD, MN820 VIN",
    "F133 VDD-SYS/VDD-CORE >= 2 ms after VCC-IO (F133 DS 5.12.1); VCC-RTC no later than other F133 rails",
    "F133 RESET held low until all F133 rails are stable for > 64 ms (F133 DS 5.12.1)",
    "T35 CRESET_N held low tCRESET_N after all T35 rails are stable, then released (T35 step 4). F133 PE8 can re-trigger configuration later",
    "PSRAM: VDD on 3V3; tPU 150 us with CLK low, CE# high, SIO low is met by board pull resistors while T35 is unconfigured (see passives) and by the controller's PU counter after user mode"
  ],
